- **QA Automation:** UI automation, CI/CD testing, regression testing, build verification.
- **Security Tester:** Vulnerability assessment, local data encryption, sync security, privilege escalation, injection, credential store audits.
- **DevOps:** CI/CD pipelines, cross-OS build environments, automated testing, deployment, update mechanisms.
